	fontsize=15 label="\n\n
The text below is about the account payable process. It begins when you send to the receiving department. 
After sending to the receiving department, creating a receiving report should be done. 
When creating a receiving report is completed, one or more of the following paths should be executed: reporting errors to relevant team member, confirming all documents have been amended, doubling check a three-way match. 
Afterwards, scheduling the payment should be done. 
The process is now completed. 
"
	fontsize=15 label="\n\n
The text below is about the account payable process which begins when you send to the receiving department.
After sending to the recipient department, a receiving report should be created.
When a receiving report is completed, one or more of the following paths should be executed: submitting errors to the relevant team member, confirming all documents have been amended, double-checking a three-way match.
Afterwards, the amount should be scheduled.
The process is now complete.
"
